      "get": {
        "description": "Identity Intelligence: who is this on-chain actor? Returns the canonical\nEntityProfile (identity_state in attributed | unattributed | not_measured |\nconflicting) wrapped in the v1 envelope. Requires `Authorization: Bearer\nsk-xemas-<key>`; per-key rate limit applies.",
